reconstructed fixtures/node-tools/v8_1/node-config/api_missing.* (the helper protocol, contracts/helper-protocol-delta.md "Frames", research D-2, D-10, and research D-4 of feature 020: the API check before start writes api missing <what> and exits 4), request names=ClusterName.
Copied unchanged: ClientHelper checks the same ClusterClient.getNodeConfigurationProperty(NodeName, String) for op=nodeConfig in both variants (its API check runs before the variant's client is created; the method answered on 9.0.10 in spike T060); no start frame, so no REST client line and no login. Not verified against a 9.0 client without that method.
